  "description": "Protect your Tesla Model Y Juniper 2025-2026 with OEDRO 9PCS all-weather floor mats. Crafted from durable TPE and digitally measured for a precise fit, these liners feature raised edges, deep channels, and waterproof protection to keep your interior clean in any season. Complete coverage includes passenger floors, trunks, storage well, and rear seat backrest.\nFeatures\nCustom Fit for Tesla Model Y Juniper 2025-2026 5-Seater only: Designed exclusively for Tesla Model Y Juniper 5-seat models, these floor mats are engineered using advanced 3D laser scanning technology for a precise fit. The liners follow the contours of your vehicle’s interior for maximum coverage and protection. Not compatible with Model Y 7-Seater or Standard Model Y.\nPremium TPE Material Built for Long-Term Protection: Made from high-quality, eco-friendly TPE material, these Tesla Model Y floor mats offer excellent durability, flexibility, and temperature resistance. The sturdy construction withstands daily wear, heavy use, and extreme weather conditions while remaining soft and odor-free.\nAll-Weather Defense with Raised Edges & Deep Channels: Featuring a tri-extruded TPE design with raised lips and deep grooves, the mats effectively trap mud, water, snow, sand, and spills. The waterproof and stain-resistant surface helps protect your Tesla’s original carpet in every season.\nComplete 9-Piece Interior Coverage: The full set includes 2 front floor liners, 1 rear floor liner, 1 front trunk cargo liner, 1 rear trunk cargo liner, 1 rear trunk well storage liner, and 1 rear seat backrest mat. Enjoy comprehensive protection for both passenger areas and cargo spaces.\nEasy Installation & Hassle-Free Maintenance: Designed for quick installation and removal, these floor liners feature secure positioning clips to help keep them firmly in place. Simply wipe clean or rinse with water to restore a fresh appearance. Please remove existing floor mats before installation for the best fit.\n2-years warranty. For your safety, professional installation is highly recommended.\nFitment\nCompatible with Tesla Model Y Juniper 2025-2026(Not fit Standard)\nNote: For 5-Seater ONLY",
  "highlights": [
    "Premium Interior Protection: OEDRO Floor mats trap dirt, debris, and liquids to keep your vehicle floor clean and protected.",
    "Secure Driving Confidence: Anti-slip texture keeps mats firmly in place, helping ensure a safer and more stable ride.",
    "Built to Last: Durable, recyclable Thermoplastic Elastomer construction delivers long-term protection with easy maintenance."
  ],
